// trap: a true rule whose proof needs a lemma that reads a run mark (#428). Open is split
// across two APIs: Open_1 sets a door ajar only while no light is off, and Open_2 lights a
// sign with no guard. TurnOff turns a light off only while no door is ajar and no sign is
// lit. So a light is never off while a sign is lit, at any count. The rule is not inductive
// alone: from a door between Open's two steps and a light off, which no reachable state
// has, Open_2 breaks it. Prop also sets a door ajar, with no guard, so a light off with an
// ajar door is reachable, and the two states differ only in the door's run mark
// (`Door._run_Open`): the fact that rules the CTI out reads the mark, and it relates a light
// and a door that no key links, so no mined lemma states it. z3 leaves the rule unproved,
// and BFS finds nothing; z3_lemma_run_mark.rdra adds the fact as a `.lemma()`.
// expect MultiForbidden_Light_0: native=ok tlc=ok z3=unproved bfs=ok,ok,ok
// expect Deadlock_Light_state_on: native=counterexample tlc=counterexample
// expect Deadlock_Sign_state_dark: native=counterexample tlc=counterexample
entity Light "照明" { id: Int @pk  state: Enum(on, off) @default(on) }
entity Door "扉" { id: Int @pk  state: Enum(closed, ajar) @default(closed) }
entity Sign "標識" { id: Int @pk  state: Enum(dark, lit) @default(dark) }
usecase Install "照明設置"
usecase Fit "扉設置"
usecase Hang "標識設置"
usecase TurnOff "消灯"
usecase Prop "扉を押さえる"
usecase Open "開放"
api DoorApi "扉 API"
api SignApi "標識 API"
creates(Install, Light)
creates(Fit, Door)
creates(Hang, Sign)
transitions(TurnOff, Light.state, on -> off)
transitions(Prop, Door.state, closed -> ajar)
invokes(Open, DoorApi)
updates(DoorApi, Door)
transitions(Open, Door.state, closed -> ajar)
invokes(Open, SignApi)
updates(SignApi, Sign)
transitions(Open, Sign.state, dark -> lit)
condition LightsOn "消えた照明がない"
holds(LightsOn, Door.state == closed).none(Light.state == off)
applies_to(LightsOn, Open)
condition DoorsShut "押さえた扉がない"
holds(DoorsShut, Light.state == on).none(Door.state == ajar)
applies_to(DoorsShut, TurnOff)
condition SignsDark "点いた標識がない"
holds(SignsDark, Light.state == on).none(Sign.state == lit)
applies_to(SignsDark, TurnOff)
forbidden(Light, Sign, Light.state == off, Sign.state == lit).global()
